# Bastion host SSH daemon config — KexAlgorithms line predates the 2017
# hardening pass and was never revisited since the bastion "just works".
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no

KexAlgorithms diffie-hellman-group1-sha1,curve25519-sha256
Ciphers aes256-ctr,3des-cbc
MACs hmac-sha2-256,hmac-md5

PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
